  "intro": "The first four workflows read the same daily table. The first fetches it from the authors' Zenodo package; the second reuses that table node, and the third and fourth read the copy already on your device. The fifth reads the ozone monitors' site-day file from the same package, and the boroughs from geoBoundaries. Start from an empty canvas: Project, then New project.",
