          "value": "How much does ozone raise visits?"
        },
        {
          "note": "The same file, with the columns the authors' model uses: ozone, PM2.5 and NO2 averaged over the day and the two before, per 10 units; temperature averaged over four days; holidays; and the year-month-weekday stratum."
